OL,3,GNEWSAPath closure and seaweed
OL,4,A'hampering' beach access
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople trying to access a beach say
OL,7,Fthey are struggling because of a path
OL,8,Fclosure and a build-up of seaweed.
OL,10,FThe path leading to the north end of
OL,11,FWhitley Bay beach at the old boat house
OL,12,Fwas closed in August 2025 when the
OL,13,Fbuilding was demolished.
OL,15,FNorth Tyneside Council said the path
OL,16,Fremained unsafe and bringing it up to
OL,17,Fstandard would involve significant
OL,18,Fcost, however critics have expressed
OL,19,Ffears that seaweed collecting at an
OL,20,Falternative entrance could prevent
OL,21,Fvisitors and emergency services
OL,22,Faccessing the sands.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
