OL,3,GNEWSAPath closure and seaweed
OL,4,A'hampering' beach access
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Labour-led authority said kelp, a
OL,7,Flarge brown algae, provided an
OL,8,Fimportant habitat for wildlife and was
OL,9,Fnot routinely removed.
